{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IT'S 1949; WORLD WAR II RAGES ON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Europe is on its knees. Deadly Axis Mechs patrol the landscape, intimidating the populace and flushing out rebels. Survivors are few, but have regrouped under the new flag of The Resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the free world\u2019s last hope. Your deadly mission; deliver a devastating EMP weapon into heart of enemy territory to turn the tide of the war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/Sandfall_GIF_Axis.gif?t=1743026360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/G_V1949_SteamStoreHeaders_V1_1.png?t=1743026360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy your Mech Squad and command them in real time to fend off waves of enemies.\u00a0 Each new battlefield presents a new challenge with unique combinations of adversaries and terrain. Think fast to use higher ground and cover, exploit enemy weaknesses, and utilise tactical advantages to withstand the assault, while defending your Command Vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/Realtimegameplay-optimize.gif?t=1743026360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/G_V1949_SteamStoreHeaders_V1_2.png?t=1743026360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your tactics may be sound, but if you reach the end of your run, you\u2019ll need to make one last stand against a menacing Axis General. These end of Region boss battles will have you facing overwhelming odds, wave upon wave of elite enemies, new hazards, and Kaiju-sized Boss Mechs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/DevastatingBosses-optimize.gif?t=1743026360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/G_V1949_SteamStoreHeaders_V1_3.png?t=1743026360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your Command Vehicle is destroyed, your Mission is over. Regroup at the Resistance Base, rebuild and upgrade your squad, and redeploy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Scrap and Valor you earn in the field can be used to upgrade Mechs and level up Pilot abilities. But prepare for the unexpected; the battlefields, enemies you face, and any rewards you receive, will never be the same twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a stand, liberate Europe and free the world. Make this your finest hour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/Regrouprebuild-optimize.gif?t=1743026360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Earning Your License","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911860/4e231041cb27bc35be4d9d698386d390b68045de.jpg"},{"name":"We Shall Defend Our Island","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911860/88703ab5d766d97c50f284945d6e6ea6d522e7c0.jpg"},{"name":"Arctic Warfare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911860/9818a249efb2fec87a5d5eadcd966cb5f951e0d5.jpg"},{"name":"Vive La R\u00e9sistance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911860/d565ad215d15cf4e5ac61c9b228d4f7565fe8169.jpg"},{"name":"Great Circuits Fall Quiet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911860/f2a32524f4d93b14be4fa209979f245fa13492ac.jpg"},{"name":"No One Left Behind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911860/bf5a35b71226c7ae4cad41af8fe563b53a3c55b8.jpg"},{"name":"Jack of All Trades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911860/edfdd45f8cfe93538bc76d7ef488642e858099f9.jpg"},{"name":"Going All In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911860/0e287eaabd6f91f8c726ec5933d48fd10a8cb507.jpg"},{"name":"Failure's Not an Option","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911860/32a44c2362172f248e7ddf8b8de159d49527b849.jpg"},{"name":"Subsistence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911860/a3cf6686cd36b7fc0d88ba5eec2082a71a130ec0.jpg"}],"total":42},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1911860?t=1743026360","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743026360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/93ad0ea1eceef915c4b217918b54c46f9bb555e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743026360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/93ad0ea1eceef915c4b217918b54c46f9bb555e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743026360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":6