60/1a4d63132bca3d8794cb2e653bc206ea04c1f7cc/ss_1a4d63132bca3d8794cb2e653bc206ea04c1f7cc.600x338.jpg?t=1743026360"}],"short_description":"A dieselpunk real-time tactics roguelite set in an alt-history World War 2. Grit and Valor \u2013 1949 puts you in command of an elite Mech Squadron. Think fast and battle the Evil Axis forces to liberate Europe. Upgrade your Mechs and Pilots and develop new strategies to neutralise the enemy HQ!","steam_appid":1911860,"support_info":{"email":"hello@megabit-publishing.com","url":"https://megabit-publishing.com/games/grit-and-valor-1949"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Russian, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://megabit-publishing.com/games/grit-and-valor-1949"}